4?t=1752718499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage the Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your factory grows, so does the madness! Conveyors overflow, parts scatter, and unexpected physics mishaps keep you on your toes. Tweak your designs, optimize machine placement, and find creative solutions to keep the gears turning and the chaos under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846120/extras/ce87137134ce82e027d8355fa469072c.poster.avif?t=1752718499\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846120/extras/ce87137134ce82e027d8355fa469072c.webm?t=1752718499\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846120/extras/ce87137134ce82e027d8355fa469072c.mp4?t=1752718499\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","developers":["Gvarados","Diomonder"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846120/481ff222fcb01d6c207af0832e689e8d060c9a26/header.jpg?t=1752718499","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"MineMogul","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> D